<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<section class="page-head"><div class="wrap narrow">
  <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: 2 November 2026</p>
</div></section>
<div class="wrap narrow prose legal">
  <p>Cookies are small text files a website stores in your browser. We keep ours to a minimum, and anything beyond the essentials only switches on if you say yes.</p>
  <p><button type="button" class="btn" data-cookie-settings>Change my cookie settings</button></p>
  <p class="small muted" data-cookie-status></p>

  <h2>Essential cookies (always on)</h2>
  <table class="table">
    <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>What it does</th><th>How long</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>sid</code></td><td>Keeps you signed in.</td><td>14 days</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>csrf</code></td><td>Protects forms from being submitted by other websites.</td><td>30 days</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>flash</code></td><td>Shows one-off messages like “Your enquiry was sent”.</td><td>1 minute</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>cookie_consent</code></td><td>Remembers the cookie choices you made here.</td><td>6 months</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Analytics cookies (optional)</h2>
  <p>If you allow them, these help us understand which pages and listings people visit, so we can improve the site. The data is aggregated and isn't used to identify you.</p>

  <h2>Marketing cookies (optional)</h2>
  <p>If you allow them, these let us measure whether our adverts on other websites (for example social media) brought you here.</p>

  <h2>Changing your mind</h2>
  <p>Use the “Cookie settings” link at the bottom of any page, or the button above. You can also clear cookies in your browser settings, though you'll be signed out.</p>

  <p>See also our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
